## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Port Already in Use

If you encounter port conflicts:
```bash
# Check what's using the port
docker ps

# Stop conflicting Docker projects
docker compose -p nova-prod down
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev down

# Kill process on specific port (Windows)
netstat -ano | findstr :3308
taskkill /PID <PID> /F

# Kill process on specific port (Linux/Mac)
lsof -ti:3308 | xargs kill -9
```

### Database Connection Issues
```bash
# Check if MySQL is healthy
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev ps

# Restart MySQL container
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev restart mysql

# Check MySQL logs
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev logs mysql

# Connect to MySQL directly
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev exec mysql mysql -uroot -p
```

### Redis Connection Issues
```bash
# Restart Redis container
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev restart redis

# Test Redis connection
docker compose -p inventory-app-dev exec redis redis-cli ping
```

### Prisma Issues
```bash
# Regenerate Prisma Client
npx prisma generate

# Reset database (WARNING: destroys all data)
npx prisma migrate reset

# Check migration status
npx prisma migrate status

# View Prisma schema drift
npx prisma migrate diff
```

### Docker Build Issues
```bash
# Clear Docker cache and rebuild
docker compose -p nova-prod build --no-cache

# Remove all stopped containers
docker container prune

# View build logs
docker compose -p nova-prod build --progress=plain server

# Check if migrations folder exists in image
docker compose -p nova-prod run --rm server ls -la /app/prisma/migrations/
```

### TypeScript Compilation Errors
```bash
# Check for type errors
pnpm type-check

# Rebuild server TypeScript
pnpm server:build

# Check server TypeScript config
cat server/tsconfig.json
```

### No Database Tables After Migration
```bash
# Check if migrations exist locally
ls prisma/migrations

# If no migrations, create initial migration
npx prisma migrate dev --name init

# Rebuild Docker images to include migrations
pnpm prod:build

# Manually run migrations
docker compose -p nova-prod run --rm prisma-migrate npx prisma migrate deploy
```

